{% if r.summary and r.summary.text %}
{{ r.summary.text | esc }}

{% elif c.claims_reported %}
The research workflow identified {{ c.claims_reported }} reportable claim(s). Review the findings and evidence-quality notes below. A consolidated narrative summary was not available.

{% else %}
{{ c.no_findings_note | default("No reportable findings were produced by this research run.") | esc }}
{% endif %}

{% if c.claims_reported %}
**Research output:** {{ c.claims_reported }} reportable claim(s) from {{ c.sources_registered }} registered source(s).
{% endif %}

{% if c.degraded %}
**Research limitations:** {{ c.degraded | join("; ") | esc }}
{% endif %}

