{% for s in r.subjects %}
### {{ s.name | esc }}{% if s.role %} — {{ s.role | esc }}{% endif %}

{% if s.resolution_note %}
**Identity assessment:** {{ s.resolution_note | esc }}
{% else %}
**Identity assessment:** Subject resolution details were not supplied.
{% endif %}

{% if s.findings %}
**Findings available:** {{ s.findings | length }}
{% else %}
**Findings available:** No established findings in the reportable results.
{% endif %}

{% if s.disputed %}
**Unresolved evidence:** Conflicting claims are listed separately in Section 4.
