## 6. References

References identify the source material associated with extracted claims. A reference supports traceability; its inclusion does not imply independent verification.

{% if r.appendix %}
{% for a in r.appendix %}
### {{ refs.by_claim.get(a.get("claim_id"), "R" ~ loop.index) }} — {{ a.get("title") or a.get("source") or "Source record" | esc }}

{% if a.get("publisher") %}
**Publisher:** {{ a.get("publisher") | esc }}
{% elif a.get("source") %}
**Source:** {{ a.get("source") | esc }}
{% endif %}

{% if a.get("published_at") %}
**Publication date:** {{ a.get("published_at") }}
{% endif %}

{% if a.get("retrieved_at") %}
**Retrieved:** {{ a.get("retrieved_at") }}
{% endif %}

{% if a.get("url") %}
**URL:** {{ a.get("url") | url }}
{% endif %}

{% if a.get("status") %}
**Evidence status:** {{ a.get("status") | replace("_", " ") | title }}
{% endif %}

{% if a.get("passage") %}
**Relevant extracted passage:** {{ a.get("passage") | esc }}
{% endif %}

{% if a.get("claim_id") %}
