## 7. Research coverage and limitations

This section describes the scope of the automated search. Retrieval volume is not a measure of research quality, and search results do not establish that all relevant records have been found.

- **Queries executed:** {{ c.queries_run }}
- **Search providers:** {{ c.providers_used | join(", ") if c.providers_used else "Not recorded" }}
- **Sources registered after deduplication:** {{ c.sources_registered }}
- **Evidence date range:** {% if c.earliest_event %}{{ c.earliest_event }} to {{ c.latest_event }}{% else %}No dated events recorded{% endif %}
- **Claims processed:** {{ c.claims_total }} total; {{ c.claims_reported }} reported.
- **Claims outside the review window:** {{ c.out_of_window }}
- **Undated claims:** {{ c.undated }}
- **Excluded for identity mismatch:** {{ c.excluded_identity }}
- **Excluded as unsupported or flagged:** {{ c.excluded_unsupported }}

